From 020e3a4bfc59e21714aa0796f9cec1cb8d94fc40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apply <apply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:16:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 38/38] 0038-run-pack-names-roots

[Delta 0038] run_pack.py: pack entries may be run names (resolved against the unique
index.json name); a dict-form packs file carries run_root / data_root (per-pack
pack_meta data_root wins) exported to the children as BNJ_RUN_ROOT / BNJ_DATA_ROOT;
conflicting environment values and unknown names are refused (exit 2) before any arm
starts. A legacy list of row-number lists is unchanged. Test: tests/test_run_pack_delta.py.
---
 code/run_pack.py                  | 58 ++++++++++++++++++-
 code/tests/test_run_pack_delta.py | 93 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 code/tests/test_run_pack_delta.py

